  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This serves 6 and takes about 1 hour from start to table. The thing to watch is the pistou: make it at the last moment so the basil stays vivid green. Stir it in at the table rather than into the pot so people can see and smell it arrive."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cut everything roughly the same size so the vegetables cook at the same rate. Uneven chunks mean some things turn to mush while others are still firm."
          }
        ]
      },
